Source: @MODULE@
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), dh-dkms
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: @PACKAGE@
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         dkms,
         linux-headers-amd64 | linux-headers-arm64 | linux-headers-generic
Description: DVB driver modules for @PROFILE@ (DKMS)
 Out-of-tree DVB modules for the @PROFILE@ tuner, taken from the tbsdtv
 linux_media tree. Only the modules this device needs are built; the package
 ships the source directories they live in, because their headers reference
 each other.
 .
 DKMS rebuilds them for every kernel that is installed, so the tuner keeps
 working across kernel updates without manual intervention. This holds as
 long as the sources still build against the new kernel; a kernel API break
 needs updated sources, like any out-of-tree driver.
 .
 The tuner firmware is not shipped with this package; see
 /usr/share/doc/@PACKAGE@/README.Debian for how to obtain it.
